  "body": "https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/dom.html#global-attributes:classes-3\r\n\r\n> [...] authors are encouraged to use values that describe the nature of the content, rather than values that describe the desired presentation of the content.\r\n\r\nI believe this statement should be updated:\r\n* in case it's still considered to be in accordance with current best practices, it should provide additional rationale and, among other things, explain how this recommendation is reconcilable with the popularity of utility-first CSS frameworks (e.g. Tailwind CSS)\r\n* otherwise, it should align with current best practices\r\n",
